== lab-E3-L01-1.py
Part A: expected value and expected utility, exact
lottery A expected_value_cents 15000 eu_linear 15000 eu_quadratic 45000
lottery B expected_value_cents 12500 eu_linear 12500 eu_quadratic 21250
lottery C expected_value_cents 15000 eu_linear 15000 eu_quadratic 37500
Part B: linearity in the probabilities for the mixture alpha*A + (1 - alpha)*C
alpha 1/4 utility linear mixture_eu 15000 linear_combination 15000 equal True
alpha 1/4 utility quadratic mixture_eu 39375 linear_combination 39375 equal True
alpha 1/3 utility linear mixture_eu 15000 linear_combination 15000 equal True
alpha 1/3 utility quadratic mixture_eu 40000 linear_combination 40000 equal True
alpha 1/2 utility linear mixture_eu 15000 linear_combination 15000 equal True
alpha 1/2 utility quadratic mixture_eu 41250 linear_combination 41250 equal True
all_linearity_checks True
Part C: pairwise order under u and under v = 3 + 2u
pair A B utility linear order_u greater order_v greater same True
pair A B utility quadratic order_u greater order_v greater same True
pair A C utility linear order_u equal order_v equal same True
pair A C utility quadratic order_u greater order_v greater same True
pair B C utility linear order_u less order_v less same True
pair B C utility quadratic order_u less order_v less same True
all_affine_orders_preserved True
Part D: invalid lotteries are rejected
rejected negative message probabilities must be non-negative
rejected short message probabilities must sum to 1
exit 0
